           05  ZONE-OUT.
               10  Z-OUT          PIC X(4).
               10  P-OUT          PIC X.
               10  FILLER         PIC X.
           05  SHIFT-OUT          PIC X.
           05  WOSTAT-OUT         PIC XX.
           05  WONUM-OUT.
               10  WONO-OUT       PIC X(7).
               10  WOSU-OUT       PIC X(3).
           05  WODESC-OUT         PIC X(30).
           05  EQNUM-OUT          PIC X(6).
